// --- Daily copywep damage mul (server local calendar date as seed) ---
// Official ids 1..officialCount from Mega DefineCopyWep order (frozen after vanilla).
// DECORATE: damage (CallACS("uh_TodayDmgMul", base)); ACS infers wep from activator.

// Helpers whose class / DamageType do not prefix-match an official stem.
